{
  "name": "Schedule image posts from Google Sheets rows with TemplateFox and Nadia",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Turn spreadsheet rows into designed image posts\n\n> **Self-hosted n8n only.** This template uses the `n8n-nodes-nadia` community node, which n8n has not verified yet. Install it first: Settings -> Community Nodes -> Install -> `n8n-nodes-nadia`.\n\nA row of data is not a post. Once a day this workflow reads the rows of a Google Sheet still marked as not posted, renders each one through a TemplateFox image template, hands the image URL to Nadia, and schedules the post on the channel you choose. Nadia fetches the image itself, so no binary travels through n8n.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. **Every morning** starts the run, and **Your settings** holds the template id.\n2. **Read rows to post** returns the rows whose `posted` column is `no`.\n3. **Render with TemplateFox** sends the row as template data and gets back an image URL.\n4. **Upload the image** stores it in the Nadia media library.\n5. **Schedule the post** books it in the next free slot with the image and the row's `caption`.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Add your **Nadia** credential: API key from Settings -> Developers in Nadia, host `https://app.usenadia.com/api`.\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential named `x-api-key` holding your TemplateFox API key, and select it in **Render with TemplateFox**.\n3. Put your template id in **Your settings**.\n4. Point **Read rows to post** at your sheet: a `caption` and a `posted` column, plus one column per template field.\n5. Open **Schedule the post**, pick your channel, then close and reopen the node: its settings load at that moment. Fill them.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 780
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -660,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The data\nOne row per post to publish.",
        "width": 680,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-note1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The image\nTemplateFox renders the row into a designed image and returns its URL.",
        "width": 280,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-note2",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The post\nNadia fetches the image, then schedules the post in the next free slot.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-note3",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "every-morning",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "template-id",
              "name": "templateId",
              "value": "your-template-id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "your-settings",
      "name": "Your settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "posted",
              "lookupValue": "no"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "read-rows-to-post",
      "name": "Read rows to post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.templatefox.com/v1/image/create",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ template_id: $('Your settings').first().json.templateId, data: $json }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "render-with-templatefox",
      "name": "Render with TemplateFox",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        740,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "TemplateFox API key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "uploadFromUrl",
        "fileUrl": "={{ $json.url }}"
      },
      "id": "upload-the-image",
      "name": "Upload the image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-nadia.nadia",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "nadiaApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Nadia account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "createPost",
        "channelId": "",
        "type": "schedule",
        "useFreeSlot": true,
        "content": "={{ $('Read rows to post').item.json.caption }}",
        "media": "={{ JSON.stringify([{ id: $json.id, path: $json.path }]) }}",
        "settings": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {}
        },
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "schedule-the-post",
      "name": "Schedule the post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-nadia.nadia",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "nadiaApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Nadia account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every morning": {
